  cycle parking facilities and thus fail to promote sustainable form of
  transport, contrary to Policy T16.2 of Merton’s Local Plan 2024 and T5 of the
  London Plan 2021.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
