  proposed water fittings to demonstrate the development will achieve internal
  water usage of less than 105 litres per person per day, the applicant has
  failed to demonstrate that the application would meet the requirement of
  Merton Local Plan 2024 policy CC2.6.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
